270 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 118 0 R
/T (According to neuroscience research analyzing more than 10,000 global news sources and executive thought leadership publications, the pace of organizational change accelerated by 183% between 2020 and 2024. This represents far more than a gradual increase. It reflects an environment in which the volume, speed, and complexity of change have exceeded the human brain's capacity to process them effectively.)
/E (According to neuroscience research analyzing more than 10,000 global news sources and executive thought leadership publications, the pace of organizational change accelerated by 183% between 2020 and 2024. This represents far more than a gradual increase. It reflects an environment in which the volume, speed, and complexity of change have exceeded the human brain's capacity to process them effectively.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
