<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 131 0 R
/T (Uncertainty will not disappear. However, organizations can design how people think, make decisions, and collaborate within uncertain environments. The organizations of the future will not be those that simply manage change; they will be those that design systems capable of enabling healthy decision-making even in the face of continuous uncertainty.)
/E (Uncertainty will not disappear. However, organizations can design how people think, make decisions, and collaborate within uncertain environments. The organizations of the future will not be those that simply manage change; they will be those that design systems capable of enabling healthy decision-making even in the face of continuous uncertainty.)
/Pg 29 0 R
/K [7]
>>
