/Title (Global research conducted with CEOs and C-suite executives points to a striking consensus: uncertainty is no longer a temporary disruption; it has become the permanent operating condition in which organizations function. Against this backdrop, this white paper brings together two complementary sources of insight.)
/Dest [14 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1736 0 R
/Next 2017 0 R
>>
