/Title (Uncertainty Architecture is not an approach designed solely to improve employee experience. Its purpose is to strengthen the organization's capacity to make effective decisions under uncertainty and ensure that this capability translates into measurable business outcomes.)
/Dest [27 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1737 0 R
/Next 1902 0 R
>>
endobj
