1904 0 obj
<<
/Title (The competitive advantage of the future will not belong to the organizations that change the fastest; it will belong to those that can preserve their capacity to think, learn, and make decisions under uncertainty. Therefore, the new strategic agenda for organizations should extend beyond change management toward building decision architectures, behavioral design systems, and brain-friendly organizational environments.)
/Dest [29 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1596 0 R
/Prev 2029 0 R
