/Title (The first consists of research published between 2025 and 2026 by leading global institutions, including McKinsey & Company, Gallup, PwC, Deloitte, The Conference Board, and the World Economic Forum. These studies provide a comprehensive view of the external realities confronting today's leaders, revealing how uncertainty, continuous change, and transformation pressures are reshaping organizations.)
/Dest [14 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1736 0 R
/Prev 1897 0 R
/Next 2054 0 R
>>
