2018 0 obj
<<
/Title (By integrating these two perspectives, this report connects the strategic pressures emerging from the external business environment with their neurobiological consequences inside organizations. In doing so, it demonstrates why the brain-based design approach presented in the following chapters is not merely an academic framework, but a strategic imperative for organizations seeking to preserve decision quality, strengthen adaptability, and build sustainable competitive advantage in an age of continuous uncertainty.)
/Dest [14 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1736 0 R
/Prev 2054 0 R
/Next 1898 0 R
>>
