2165 0 obj
<<
/Title (What leaders can do, however, is reduce the burden that uncertainty places on the nervous system.)
/Dest [21 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 2132 0 R
/Prev 2150 0 R
/Next 2166 0 R
>>
endobj
2166 0 obj
<<
/Title (The solution is not greater control, but greater predictability. Research consistently shows that people do not need complete certainty about the future; they need a meaningful framework that helps them anticipate and make sense of what lies ahead.)
/Dest [21 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 2132 0 R
/Prev 2165 0 R
/Next 2151 0 R
>>
endobj
